                    <details class="email-faq-details">
                        <summary class="email-faq-summary">
                            <span>Email iletişiminde opt-out ve unsubscribe kontrolü var mı?</span>
                            <i class="ri-arrow-down-s-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="email-faq-body">
                            Pika'nın Email iletişim bağlamında unsubscribe / opt-out handling bulunur ve mevcut suppression durumu gönderim uygunluğu kontrollerinin parçasıdır. Audience veya journey üyeliği opt-out durumunu ortadan kaldırmaz.
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="email-faq-details">
                        <summary class="email-faq-summary">
                            <span>Pika Email hangi sonuçları ölçebilir?</span>
                            <i class="ri-arrow-down-s-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="email-faq-body">
                            Mevcut Email telemetry bağlamında delivery, bounce, open, click ve unsubscribe gibi sonuçlar kampanya değerlendirmesinde kullanılabilir. Analytics & Reporting bu sonuçları ilgili kampanya, kitle ve ölçüm bağlamıyla birlikte değerlendirir.
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="email-faq-details">
                        <summary class="email-faq-summary">
                            <span>Email gönderimi inbox, açılma veya dönüşüm garantisi verir mi?</span>
                            <i class="ri-arrow-down-s-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="email-faq-body">
                            Hayır. Teknik gönderim sonucu belirli bir inbox placement, açılma, tıklama, dönüşüm, satış veya ciro sonucu garanti etmez. Bu sonuçlar birbirinden farklı ölçüm ve ticari bağlamlardır.
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="email-faq-details">
                        <summary class="email-faq-summary">
                            <span>Pika Email yapay zekâ ile kampanyayı kendi başına oluşturup gönderir mi?</span>
                            <i class="ri-arrow-down-s-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="email-faq-body">
                            Hayır. <a href="/urunler/ai-kampanya-asistani">Pika Pilot</a> Email içerik taslağı hazırlamaya yardımcı olabilir; kullanıcı içeriği değerlendirir ve Content Studio'da hazırlar. Campaign Manager veya Journey Manager aksiyonu yönetir. Email kendi başına kampanya başlatan otonom AI sistemi değildir.
                        </div>
                    </details>
                }
                else
                {
                    <details class="email-faq-details">
                        <summary class="email-faq-summary">
                            <span>What is Pika Email?</span>
                            <i class="ri-arrow-down-s-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="email-faq-body">
                            Pika Email is one of Pika's communication channels for using visual and personalizable content prepared in Content Studio within controlled communication through Campaign Manager or Journey Manager.
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="email-faq-details">
                        <summary class="email-faq-summary">
                            <span>Can visual Email templates be prepared in Pika?</span>
                            <i class="ri-arrow-down-s-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="email-faq-body">
                            Yes. Visual drag-and-drop Email composition, modular blocks, templates and device preview are managed in Content Studio. Prepared content can then be used through the Email channel.
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="email-faq-details">
                        <summary class="email-faq-summary">
                            <span>Can Email content be personalized?</span>
                            <i class="ri-arrow-down-s-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="email-faq-body">
                            Available personalization fields based on existing customer data can be added to Email content in Content Studio. Personalization does not mean creating customer information that does not exist.
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="email-faq-details">
                        <summary class="email-faq-summary">
                            <span>How does Email work with Campaign Manager and Journey Manager?</span>
                            <i class="ri-arrow-down-s-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="email-faq-body">
                            Campaign Manager manages controlled delivery for a defined campaign. Journey Manager manages multi-step flow. Email is a confirmed communication channel that can be used within both product contexts.
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="email-faq-details">
                        <summary class="email-faq-summary">
                            <span>Does Email communication include opt-out and unsubscribe handling?</span>
                            <i class="ri-arrow-down-s-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="email-faq-body">
                            Pika's Email communication context includes unsubscribe / opt-out handling, and available suppression state forms part of delivery-eligibility controls. Audience or journey membership does not remove an opt-out state.
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="email-faq-details">
                        <summary class="email-faq-summary">
                            <span>Which Email outcomes can Pika measure?</span>
                            <i class="ri-arrow-down-s-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="email-faq-body">
                            Available Email telemetry can include delivery, bounce, open, click and unsubscribe context for campaign evaluation. Analytics & Reporting evaluates those outcomes together with relevant campaign, audience and measurement context.
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="email-faq-details">
                        <summary class="email-faq-summary">
                            <span>Does Email delivery guarantee inbox placement, opens or conversion?</span>
                            <i class="ri-arrow-down-s-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="email-faq-body">
                            No. A technical delivery outcome does not guarantee a particular inbox placement, open, click, conversion, sales or revenue result. These are different measurement and commercial contexts.
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="email-faq-details">
                        <summary class="email-faq-summary">
                            <span>Does Pika Email use AI to create and send campaigns by itself?</span>
                            <i class="ri-arrow-down-s-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="email-faq-body">
                            No. <a href="/en/products/ai-campaign-assistant">Pika Pilot</a> can help prepare Email content drafts; the user reviews the content and prepares it in Content Studio. Campaign Manager or Journey Manager manages the action. Email is not an autonomous AI system that launches campaigns by itself.
                        </div>
                    </details>
                }
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

